{"sha": "3f9d2e3f3e98c8265e9724f76d97aad5056eff234d1af333ec29c210a2623c23", "body": ["\\chapter{解析几何}\\label{ch:g10:coordgeom}", "", "笛卡尔的伟大思想在于用成对的数描述点，将几何问题", "化为计算。仅凭两个公式 ---", "中点公式与距离公式 --- 便能证明一个三角形是等腰三角形、", "一个四边形是平行四边形，或三点共线，", "而无需作出任何一条辅助线。", "", "\\section{平面中的坐标}", "", "\\begin{definition}[坐标系]\\label{def:g10:coordgeom:system}", "平面的\\emph{坐标系}\\index{坐标系}由一个原点 $O$ 与", "过 $O$ 的两条带刻度的坐标轴组成：水平的", "$x$ 轴与竖直的 $y$ 轴。平面上每一点 $M$ 都有唯一一对", "有序数对 $(x, y)$，称为该点的\\emph{坐标}\\index{坐标}：", "即\\emph{横坐标}\\index{横坐标} $x$ 与", "\\emph{纵坐标}\\index{纵坐标} $y$。", "当两轴互相垂直且长度单位相同时，", "称该坐标系为\\emph{标准正交坐标系}\\index{标准正交坐标系}。", "本章中的坐标系均为标准正交的。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[thin, gray!40] (-2.4,-1.4) grid (4.4,3.4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-2.6,0) -- (4.6,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-1.6) -- (0,3.6) node[left, font=\\small] {$y$};", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small] at (0,0) {$O$};", "  \\fill[omDef] (3,2) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[above right, font=\\small, omDef] at (3,2) {$M(3, 2)$};", "  \\draw[dashed, omDef] (3,0) -- (3,2) -- (0,2);", "  \\fill[omThm] (-2,-1) circle (2pt);", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small, omThm] at (-2,-1) {$N(-2, -1)$};", "  \\foreach \\x in {1,2,3,4} \\node[below, font=\\footnotesize] at (\\x,0) {\\x};", "  \\foreach \\y in {1,2,3} \\node[left, font=\\footnotesize] at (0,\\y) {\\y};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 平面上每一点都由两个数确定：先是", "横坐标（水平方向），再是纵坐标（竖直方向）。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{线段的中点}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[中点公式]\\label{prop:g10:coordgeom:midpoint}", "设 $A(x_A, y_A)$ 与 $B(x_B, y_B)$，则", "\\emph{中点}\\index{中点} $I$ 是线段 $[AB]$ 的中点，其坐标为", "\\[", "I\\left(\\frac{x_A + x_B}{2},\\ \\frac{y_A + y_B}{2}\\right).", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "考虑水平方向的坐标。从 $A$ 到 $B$，横坐标", "改变量为 $x_B - x_A$；中点的横坐标为", "\\[", "x_A + \\frac{x_B - x_A}{2} = \\frac{2x_A + x_B - x_A}{2}", "= \\frac{x_A + x_B}{2},", "\\]", "即两个横坐标的平均数。对纵坐标作同样的计算，", "同理得到中点的纵坐标。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:coordgeom:midpoint}", "已知 $A(-1, 4)$ 与 $B(5, -2)$，则 $[AB]$ 的中点为", "\\[", "I\\left(\\frac{-1 + 5}{2},\\ \\frac{4 + (-2)}{2}\\right) = I(2, 1).", "\\]", "公式也可反过来用：若 $A(-1, 4)$ 且其中点为", "$I(2, 1)$，则 $B$ 满足 $\\frac{-1 + x_B}{2} = 2$ 且", "$\\frac{4 + y_B}{2} = 1$，于是 $x_B = 5$，$y_B = -2$：点 $B$ 是", "$A$ 关于 $I$ 的\\emph{中心对称点}。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{两点间的距离}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[距离公式]\\label{thm:g10:coordgeom:distance}", "在标准正交坐标系中，$A(x_A, y_A)$ 与", "$B(x_B, y_B)$ 之间的距离为", "\\[", "AB = \\sqrt{(x_B - x_A)^2 + (y_B - y_A)^2}.", "\\]", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "设点 $C$ 为 $(x_B, y_A)$：它与 $A$ 的纵坐标相同，且与 $B$ 的", "横坐标相同，故三角形 $ACB$ 在 $C$ 处为直角。其", "两条直角边为水平与竖直方向的线段，长度分别为", "$AC = \\abs{x_B - x_A}$，$CB = \\abs{y_B - y_A}$。由", "勾股定理，", "\\[", "AB^2 = AC^2 + CB^2 = (x_B - x_A)^2 + (y_B - y_A)^2,", "\\]", "两边均非负，开平方即得公式。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.85]", "  \\draw[thin, gray!40] (-0.4,-0.4) grid (5.4,3.4);", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (-0.6,0) -- (5.6,0) node[below, font=\\small] {$x$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth] (0,-0.6) -- (0,3.6) node[left, font=\\small] {$y$};", "  \\coordinate (A) at (1,1);", "  \\coordinate (B) at (5,3);", "  \\coordinate (C) at (5,1);", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (A) -- (B);", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (A) -- (C) node[midway, below, font=\\small]", "    {$\\abs{x_B - x_A}$};", "  \\draw[omThm, thick] (C) -- (B) node[midway, right, font=\\small]", "    {$\\abs{y_B - y_A}$};", "  \\draw[thin] (C) ++(-0.25,0) -- ++(0,0.25) -- ++(0.25,0);", "  \\fill (A) circle (2pt) node[above left, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\fill (B) circle (2pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\fill (C) circle (2pt) node[below right, font=\\small] {$C$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}